1
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,110
Sorry, Dr. Jiang.

2
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:11,170
I had to deal with an emergency.

3
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:11,890
Director.

4
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,770
Mrs. Chen personally recommended you.

5
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,610
Whatever you need, just say the word.

6
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,540
I'll make it happen.

7
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,740
It's okay, Director.

8
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:23,490
If you don't mind,

9
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:27,370
I'd like to take care of Miss Wen's rehab.

10
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,020
You're awake.

11
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:49,970
Bad dream?

12
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:56,910
Dad, why are you here?

13
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:02,500
How did that woman die?

14
00:01:03,090 --> 00:01:03,820
Tell me!

15
00:01:05,170 --> 00:01:06,500
Dad, what are you doing?

16
00:01:07,090 --> 00:01:09,289
I... I hit her with my car.

17
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:15,520
Sweetheart,

18
00:01:16,810 --> 00:01:17,620
are you okay?

19
00:01:20,580 --> 00:01:21,440
Remember this.

20
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:24,700
You never say that,
no matter who asks.

21
00:01:25,530 --> 00:01:26,730
Not even the police.

22
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,860
Even if they have you by the throat,

23
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:31,090
you tell them

24
00:01:31,370 --> 00:01:32,060
it was Jie

25
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:33,910
who killed her.

26
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:39,370
Okay.

27
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:43,620
Here, have an apple.

28
00:01:48,979 --> 00:01:49,729
Come on.

29
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,360
How are you feeling, sweetheart?

30
00:02:00,910 --> 00:02:02,070
Chen Xingye.

31
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:04,710
You've got some nerve coming here!

32
00:02:07,530 --> 00:02:08,970
You embarrassed yourself,

33
00:02:08,970 --> 00:02:10,220
not Xingye.

34
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,650
Why shouldn't he come?

35
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:18,410
Look who decided to show up.

36
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:20,160
Mr. He, the busiest man in town.

37
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:21,690
Here to see our daughter?

38
00:02:21,690 --> 00:02:23,460
You could've told me.

39
00:02:24,070 --> 00:02:26,560
We could've come together.

40
00:02:28,020 --> 00:02:29,340
You're always busy.

41
00:02:29,410 --> 00:02:30,810
I thought I'd come alone.

42
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:32,130
I'm sorry, Jianan.

43
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:34,430
But I really didn't leak those photos.

44
00:02:41,570 --> 00:02:44,300
Jianan, I don't mean to criticize you,

45
00:02:44,650 --> 00:02:46,650
but you had a fiancé.

46
00:02:46,810 --> 00:02:48,540
So why take pictures like that?

47
00:02:48,650 --> 00:02:49,980
And you let them get out.

48
00:02:50,130 --> 00:02:53,500
I'm your mother,
and even I feel embarrassed.

49
00:02:54,570 --> 00:02:56,690
Xingye was devastated.

50
00:02:56,850 --> 00:02:58,850
That's why he ended the engagement.

51
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:00,780
I don't blame him.

52
00:03:03,430 --> 00:03:05,060
[Dearest Episode 2]

53
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:08,450
You guys...

54
00:03:14,970 --> 00:03:17,340
I still have plenty
to deal with at the office.

55
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:18,060
Jianan,

56
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:19,900
get some rest.

57
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:21,500
I'll visit another time.

58
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,840
Go see your father when you can.

59
00:03:32,370 --> 00:03:33,690
He keeps asking about you.

60
00:03:33,690 --> 00:03:35,460
I know him.

61
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:38,060
With a son-in-law like you,

62
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:40,300
he probably forgets I exist.

63
00:03:59,370 --> 00:04:00,130
Mom.

64
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:02,340
You are really pitiful.

65
00:04:03,300 --> 00:04:04,940
After all these years,

66
00:04:05,130 --> 00:04:07,970
you're still using these pathetic tricks

67
00:04:08,340 --> 00:04:10,180
to get Dad's attention?

68
00:04:11,650 --> 00:04:13,530
He doesn't care.

69
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:17,420
Bring a hundred men in front of him.

70
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:19,500
Or even a thousand.

71
00:04:21,769 --> 00:04:23,620
He still wouldn't care.

72
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:26,810
He cares about

73
00:04:27,130 --> 00:04:29,420
our family's money and power.

74
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:31,100
Not you.

75
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:35,370
And now you're going after my leftovers.

76
00:05:04,690 --> 00:05:06,330
Where did he get that ring?

77
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:32,810
Miss Wen.

78
00:05:33,610 --> 00:05:35,690
I'm Jiang Yu, your rehab therapist.

79
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:38,060
Time for your session.

80
00:05:42,659 --> 00:05:44,460
Your hand muscles are too tight.

81
00:05:44,690 --> 00:05:45,950
Let me work them loose.

82
00:05:47,659 --> 00:05:48,940
Don't touch me.

83
00:05:49,060 --> 00:05:50,130
I don't need rehab.

84
00:05:50,130 --> 00:05:50,770
Get out.

85
00:05:51,659 --> 00:05:52,690
Doctor.

86
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:54,740
Haven't I seen you somewhere?

87
00:05:55,210 --> 00:05:56,690
You look familiar.

88
00:05:56,690 --> 00:05:57,860
I just started here.

89
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,800
We haven't met.

90
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:04,740
Don't go, Dr. Jiang.

91
00:06:07,660 --> 00:06:09,210
Weren't you here to help me?

92
00:06:39,770 --> 00:06:41,300
This is the inpatient ward.

93
00:06:42,210 --> 00:06:45,130
The fire alarms are extremely sensitive.

94
00:07:25,790 --> 00:07:33,650
♪ Cold rain falls across my skin ♪

95
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:43,060
♪ Lost in the smoke, I slowly disappear ♪

96
00:07:39,770 --> 00:07:41,250
He took our clothes.

97
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:42,010
Go get them!

98
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:46,310
♪ Where are we supposed to go? ♪

99
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:51,659
♪ Is there any chance we can win? ♪

100
00:07:53,550 --> 00:08:00,400
♪ Red warning lights flicker in my eyes ♪

101
00:08:01,130 --> 00:08:02,930
That was the day I made up my mind.

102
00:08:02,970 --> 00:08:05,510
♪ Crashing over me like waves ♪

103
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:06,330
On this road to revenge...

104
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:11,640
♪ The truth is finally coming to light ♪

105
00:08:06,570 --> 00:08:09,940
No matter what happens,
I will fight for myself.

106
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:12,010
And whoever tries to stop me...

107
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:16,660
♪ Everything in this room
is falling apart ♪

108
00:08:12,250 --> 00:08:14,330
I'll strike back, one by one.

109
00:08:14,890 --> 00:08:17,540
Even if it's my own mother.

110
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,440
♪ All I can hear ♪

111
00:08:18,130 --> 00:08:19,620
He appeared at just the right moment...

112
00:08:18,460 --> 00:08:21,160
♪ Is the roar of your heartbeat ♪

113
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:22,180
and became my weapon.

114
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,980
♪ Not to set me free ♪

115
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:25,980
♪ But to drag me into the abyss ♪

116
00:08:26,010 --> 00:08:27,530
♪ Beneath this rain ♪

117
00:08:27,550 --> 00:08:29,810
♪ I slowly drift into sleep ♪

118
00:08:30,370 --> 00:08:34,419
Chen Xingye. Guess I'll start with you.

119
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:45,450
You came.

120
00:08:47,090 --> 00:08:48,810
After your call last night,

121
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:49,900
I knew

122
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,210
I had to come.

123
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:57,060
I still wear

124
00:08:58,810 --> 00:09:00,850
our engagement ring.

125
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:12,360
You never wanted this, right?

126
00:09:12,610 --> 00:09:13,690
Did my dad make you

127
00:09:13,690 --> 00:09:15,180
release those photos

128
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:17,180
or threaten to destroy your career?

129
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:20,380
Jianan.

130
00:09:21,450 --> 00:09:22,780
I was happy with you.

131
00:09:23,210 --> 00:09:24,610
Truly happy.

132
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:28,260
But nobody stays together forever.

133
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,110
Then why

134
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:35,020
are you here?

135
00:09:35,110 --> 00:09:36,590
Because we need closure.

136
00:09:37,830 --> 00:09:38,780
Let's end this peacefully.

137
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:39,940
Do you remember

138
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,250
our first meeting?

139
00:09:44,690 --> 00:09:45,730
On a film set.

140
00:09:46,450 --> 00:09:49,610
We wore school uniforms
and played a piano duet

141
00:09:50,490 --> 00:09:51,970
in the auditorium.

142
00:09:54,780 --> 00:09:55,810
Can we do it

143
00:09:58,570 --> 00:10:00,690
one last time?

144
00:10:11,490 --> 00:10:13,370
I haven't played in years.

145
00:10:23,090 --> 00:10:23,940
Let's not.

146
00:10:24,730 --> 00:10:27,140
I don't want to reopen old wounds.

147
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,130
You still love me, don't you?

148
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:32,820
That's why you won't let me...

149
00:10:34,430 --> 00:10:36,010
Chen Xingye, I love you.

150
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,440
I always have.

151
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:40,450
I love you too.

152
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,750
I love your money.

153
00:11:00,180 --> 00:11:01,260
Your status.

154
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:04,510
Your last name.

155
00:11:10,690 --> 00:11:11,570
Who's there?

156
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:15,490
Well? Got it all?

157
00:11:17,190 --> 00:11:18,420
Chen Xingye, you...

158
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,030
Perfect.

159
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:22,270
Great lighting. Great angles.

160
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:25,100
A romantic reunion.

161
00:11:25,570 --> 00:11:26,900
A tearful confession.

162
00:11:27,180 --> 00:11:28,380
A reconciliation.

163
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,550
These photos

164
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:33,000
are worth three months of headlines.

165
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,450
Jianan, don't blame me.

166
00:11:48,290 --> 00:11:49,330
You lied to me.

167
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:54,180
Lied?

168
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,680
I never lied to you.

169
00:11:57,110 --> 00:11:59,380
I loved you once. That was real.

170
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:02,520
Being forced by your family was real too.

171
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:03,730
And who I love?

172
00:12:06,850 --> 00:12:08,310
I've always loved myself.

173
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:09,690
That's true as well.

174
00:12:11,570 --> 00:12:12,850
You monster.

175
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:14,180
You monster!

176
00:12:33,490 --> 00:12:35,690
You went from a nobody
serving wealthy women

177
00:12:35,690 --> 00:12:36,810
to the man

178
00:12:36,810 --> 00:12:38,810
everyone admires today.

179
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,520
And you owe it all to me.

180
00:12:40,660 --> 00:12:42,200
Wen Xin never loved you.

181
00:12:42,230 --> 00:12:43,540
You're just her toy.

182
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:46,450
When she got tired of you,
she'd throw you away.

183
00:12:46,450 --> 00:12:47,570
Shut up!

184
00:12:50,490 --> 00:12:51,300
Look at you.

185
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:52,730
You're nothing!

186
00:12:53,650 --> 00:12:55,940
Just a parasite everyone hates!

187
00:12:56,070 --> 00:12:58,530
Using your fame
was the most you could offer.

188
00:13:11,620 --> 00:13:12,520
No...

189
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:14,080
This is not true!

190
00:13:16,420 --> 00:13:17,830
This is not the truth.

191
00:13:19,770 --> 00:13:20,860
We were acting.

192
00:13:21,130 --> 00:13:22,480
Right, Jianan?

193
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,240
Jianan, please.

194
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:27,490
Tell them.

195
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:28,690
Tell them we were rehearsing.

196
00:13:28,690 --> 00:13:29,590
We were rehearsing.

197
00:13:29,590 --> 00:13:30,240
Jianan.

198
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:31,220
- Please!
- Don't hit me!

199
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:32,810
Please don't hit me!

200
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:40,420
You forced me to take those photos.

201
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,650
I did everything for you.

202
00:13:42,670 --> 00:13:44,480
Why are you hitting me now?

203
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:48,070
You even sold those photos

204
00:13:48,490 --> 00:13:50,020
to pay your gambling debts.

205
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:53,300
Wen Jianan, what are you talking about?

206
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:54,330
Are you crazy?

207
00:13:54,490 --> 00:13:55,280
Get up.

208
00:13:55,310 --> 00:13:56,470
Drop the act!

209
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:57,480
Chen Xingye.

210
00:13:59,810 --> 00:14:01,090
Welcome to

211
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,300
the hell I, Wen Jianan,

212
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:06,740
call home.
